# Room DB

- Entities/DAOs/DB in `nonWebMain`; builders in androidMain/iosMain.
- `ShopRepository` is the shared façade; web uses `InMemoryShopRepository`.
- Seed via `SeedData`; `ensureSeeded` inserts users once and upserts missing products only.
- Keep indexes on shopId/barcode/category/createdAt for dashboard queries.
- Schema export under `shared/schemas/`; bump `version` on breaking entity changes.
- KSP: `kspAndroid`, `kspIosArm64`, `kspIosSimulatorArm64`.

Before schema work, read skill `pansari-room-db` if present.
